[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_2v8or")
item_name = "Arvid's Note 2"
item_description = "Arvid's last note, found in the sunken tunnel. It ends mid-word."
item_type = 1
note_text = "\"To whoever the Institute sent to replace me — because I know they already have.

I couldn't put this on the network. They read everything that goes through that terminal. But nobody from the office would ever crawl into this tunnel. They like their data clean and their boots dry.

So listen. This was never a dormouse survey. The Institute has known what lives in these woods since long before either of us was hired. They don't send people out here to study it. They send people out here for it to study. We're the bait. Every night you survive is a data point to them.

It isn't an animal. It watches. It copies what it hears. It learned the rhythm of my footsteps through the nests, and now it walks them back to me around the cabin at night. The dormice copy it in turn. That's what the nests are: its little echoes.

I found what keeps it here. The old willow, in its own clearing south-east of the cabin — it doesn't belong among the pines, and nothing grows right around it. Something is anchored there. It only rises out of the ground at night. Pin the thing in enough light, long enough, and the anchor can be torn out.

They made an account for you on the terminal the week I asked to go home. That's how I knew you were coming. Yours can't see mine. Log in as me:
USER: STENBERG
PASSKEY: 1996

My logs are locked. The recovery tool wants the two together: STENBERG_1996. 1996 is Maja's year. I never could remember a password that wasn't one of the girls.

Read what I recovered. Finish what I couldn't.

If you make it out of these woods, find Linnea and Maja. Tell them their pappa thought of them every single hour, and most of all when the dark got heavy. Tell them I was trying to come ho—

[The writing breaks off. The pen has dragged a long, jagged line off the bottom of the page.]\""
read_thought = "Linnea and Maja. I'll tell them, Arvid. If I get out of here."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://baixx1fs8cosb"
